{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"64ece59792629f2649f5db51a2705f491a778d9663b9d8e35666be2b1f65bef8","ja":"旅行写真でPR！","zh":"用旅行照片宣传！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d7dd8a0440d7e4653110301dab692371c1b9c8316dd7fc73503c5e36cc697e29","ja":"コルクボードには、食べ歩きや名所観光を楽しむ\nアイドルたちの写真が貼られていて……","zh":"软木板上贴着偶像们享受边走边吃、\n游览名胜景点的照片……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"41c3e7d6463130228cb0ff23e0f79feed502560efe887efcdb8a25dd3cc25583","ja":"みんな、よう見てってください♪　今ならなんと、\nこんな素敵な旅ができるツアーが盛りだくさんですよ！","zh":"大家快过来瞧瞧看看吧♪　现在居然有\n这么多能够体验如此美妙旅程的旅行团哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3b24862fb1364c71aae58918f930858429c0c4dbce602827e22357d803047f77","ja":"ぜひ、パンフレットをどうぞ。こちらは、\nボードのこの写真の場所に行けるツアーです。","zh":"请务必收下宣传册。这个是\n能前往展板上这张照片所在地的旅游团。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b0f03fbf065c13c90a1af65ba4831f72a3b461044961250d956be78abb51ea11","ja":"この写真のお花畑ですか？\nえっと……あ、このツアーで行けますぅ～。","zh":"这处照片里的花田吗？\n我想想……啊，参加这个旅行团就可以去哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"6fe94425181e636fd072ec89c5aea73dfcda456531de24a46e66da438b233f8f","ja":"浴衣で温泉街を歩いてる写真が気になるのか？\nそれなら、このパンフレットに詳しく書いてるぜ！","zh":"你很在意穿着浴衣漫步在温泉街的照片吗？\n要是这样的话，这本宣传册里写得很详细哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b2f94f9c5bdff45e77cff571d5326b45722c083ec71ba5f612c2568531cb65f2","ja":"お疲れさまでした。パンフレットはすべて、\n受け取ってもらえましたね……やったぞ。","zh":"辛苦了。宣传册已经全部\n发下去了呢……太好啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"6ba8d5cad93f62e42c604fb2aef550a4ff326ceb25b6a30f40661f0355e71294","ja":"ツアーの予約も一気に増えたってさ！\nPR企画した人、大喜びだったよな！　やったぜ♪","zh":"说是旅行团的预约量也一口气暴涨了！\n负责PR企划的人高兴得不行呢！太棒啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"7ad463bb1304795a9f8d8fd198d6fce399828beb828a970d9bc22b1c3442a980","ja":"頑張ってボード作った甲斐、あったな～。\nあ、スタッフさん。お疲れさまです～。どうしました？","zh":"努力做了应援板，总算没白费呢～。\n啊，工作人员。辛苦啦～。怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"1534c6bfad3ef359bc8967b0e81d96f6a3d092438e63341f268287298f3ea0e8","ja":"「実はボードが大好評で……ボードを撮った写真を、\nツアーの特典にしてほしい、という声があるのですが」","zh":"“其实留言板大受好评……有人希望能把\n拍下留言板的照片，作为巡演的特典呢”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"9ab18c1396f39e42d39a89db5f330221975eeac6e3721889839c92b5274ae1ba","ja":"へぇ～！　めっちゃいいですね！\nお披露目一回きりやと、もったいないですし♪","zh":"诶～！太棒了吧！\n要是只展示一次的话，也太可惜了嘛♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"865420f37cdb815cd28b566654109756c6cc60e0eb33b47b90724e7185f6ad16","ja":"そうだね。みんなで頑張って用意したから、\n気に入ってもらえて嬉しいですぅ♪","zh":"是呀。因为是大家一起努力准备的，\n你能喜欢我就好开心呀♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"284075b29409d5bdc266982d5bfa711ed0bf57b99c2784a496df1a1b281cd6d7","ja":"はい……写真に写っているみんなにも\n許可をいただけたら、ぜひ。","zh":"好的……如果照片里的大家也能\n同意的话，我非常乐意。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"53eca838a697e3812949ce011dbce5483db851a61b66b51dbd4aa54f69aab9b1","ja":"みんなも絶対、OKしてくれるよ！\nオレも嬉しいもん♪","zh":"大家也绝对会答应的！\n我也很高兴呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1599.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"7f3e302d511358502145769e8765ab4a6e657c92edbf5b968e172c431a659cad","ja":"へへっ。キャンペーンガールのお仕事大成功、\nだよなっ！！","zh":"嘿嘿。活动代言人的工作大获成功\n了对吧！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
